Current Version can be found [http://undercards.wikia.com/wiki/Pyrope here].    

[[File:Pyrope.png|thumb|224x224px|Post Alpha 2.2]]
Pyrope originally had stats of 0/8, before being nerfed to 0/6 in '''Alpha 2.2''', and changed to 1/5 in '''Beta 4.2'''.    

[[File:4.2 Pyrope.png|thumb|220x220px|Post Beta 4.2]]
'''Beta 4.6''' gave it the ''Can't attack'' ability, making it unable to attack despite having 1 ATK (so its still possible to hurt attacking enemies).    

'''Beta 6.4''' changed it back to its original state of 0 ATK but able to attack (and damage with the help of ATK buffs), but kept its 5 HP.    

[[File:Pyrope 4.6.png|thumb|223x223px|Post Beta 4.6]][[File:Pyrope (Beta 30.0).png|thumb|133x133px|Beta 30.0]]
=== Trivia ===
There was a glitch discovered during Beta 4.5 that allowed for a turn to be skipped or for 6 damage to be dealt if you ended your turn just before the timer ran out with the Pyrope on board, this has since been fixed.  

